# This project is offline by design and does not load environment files.
# Keep external RPC, wallet, SSH, and deployment configuration in a separate
# caller. The CUDA worker accepts only public job fields over stdin.
#
# Example public CPU fields (do not replace with credentials):
# PROTOCOL=hashbroker84
# ADDRESS=0x1212121212121212121212121212121212121212
# CHALLENGE=0x3434343434343434343434343434343434343434343434343434343434343434
